    "https://cps.unh.edu/career-services": {
      "title": "Career Services",
      "description": "Career Services | College of Professional Studies Skip to main content University of New Hampshire Search Menu Search UNH.edu Search College of Professional Studies Search UNH.edu Search Search Commonly Searched Items: Academic Calendar Visit Tuition Registrar College of Professional Studies Online Manchester Campus Career Services Career Services Career Services Schedule an Appointment Student Resources Employers Part-time and Work-study Job Information Some students apply to college with a clear idea of what they want to do, and others use college resources to find their path. From internships to resume revamps and job fairs, UNH CPS Career and Professional Success team is here to help you thrive from your first day to graduation, and beyond. Career Support is Available 24/7 Career and Professional Success provides a number of platforms and career technology tools to assist students in building professional success. Get Career Support Part-time & Work-Study Jobs Career and Professional Success provides a number of platforms and career technology tools to assist students in building professional success. Find a Job Experiential Learning Resources Field-based Experiential Learning (CPS Online) Internships & Experiential Learning (Manchester) Career Technology Handshake UNH's main career resource. Connect with employers, search and apply for full-time jobs and internships, register for events, professional opportunities, and on-campus recruiting. Get Started Stand Out Stand Out is an innovative mock video interviewing platform designed to enhance your interviewing abilities with AI feedback! The service is free for UNH students and available to you 24/7. More and more employers are using video interviews as their first interview method, so practice, practice, practice to be prepared! Get Started Awato Provides assessments to help you plan your career goals. Using Awato, you can explore our degree program options and careers that match your interests. Get Started LinkedIn Learning Access engaging personal development courses built for your interests. Discover a world-class library of over 16,000 expertly-produced and consistently updated courses across seven languages. Get Started Looking for Support? Set up an appointment career advising appointment through your UNH myWildcat Success account. ONLINE Apply Academics Student Affairs & Wellness Home Manchester Apply Academics Student Affairs & Wellness Home Stop Campus Hazing Act Copyright © 2026, University of New Hampshire. All rights reserved. TTY Users: 7-1-1 or 800-735-2964 (Relay NH) USNH Privacy Policies  • USNH Terms of Use  • Accessibility  • Statement of Nondiscrimination  • Jeanne Clery Act Contact Us College of Professional Studies 88 Commercial St. Manchester, NH 03101 UNH Manchester: (603) 641-4101 CPS Online: (855) 472-4255 College of Professional Studies Online Manchester Campus Career Services"
