      "title": "Expert Faculty",
      "description": "Expert Faculty | Online Skip to main content This site uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. By continuing to use this site, you agree to the use of cookies, in accordance with the USNH website Privacy Policy. OK ✓ University of New Hampshire College of Professional Studies Search Menu Search UNH.edu Search College of Professional Studies Search UNH.edu Search Search Commonly Searched Items: Academic Calendar Visit Tuition Registrar Online Academics Associate Degrees Bachelor’s Degrees Three-Year (90 credit) Applied Bachelor's Degrees Master’s Degrees Post-Baccalaureate Teacher Licensure Minors Academic Catalog Early College Online Why UNH CPS Online Affordable Tuition Online Flexibility Respect for Prior Learning & Transfer Credit Military & VA Friendly Expert Faculty Personalized Advising Career Support Student Success Blog Accreditations and Achievements Employer partnerships & tuition benefits Apply & Register Apply Now Transfer Credit Evaluation Take a Course Community College of the Air Force Military and Veterans Benefits Calendars Accepted Students Registrar Tuition & Aid Tuition & Fees Types of Aid Eligibility Requirements FAFSA Financial Aid Resources Military and Veterans Benefits Tuition Waivers & Discounts Billing & Payments Resources Access My Accounts Current Students Bookstore Resources for Alumni Resources for Faculty & Staff Resources for School Counselors Employer Partnership Request CWEP Faculty & Staff Directory Highlights and News Technology Help Desk Support Contact Us Home Online Why UNH CPS Online Expert Faculty In This Section Why UNH CPS Online Affordable Tuition Online Flexibility Respect for Prior Learning & Transfer Credit Military & VA Friendly Expert Faculty Personalized Advising Career Support Student Success Blog Accreditations and Achievements Employer partnerships & tuition benefits Expert Faculty About Our Faculty Our Faculty are subject matter experts who care deeply about the mission and the students of the UNH College of Professional Studies. They enjoy opportunities to share their real-world expertise and help you apply what you learn in a way that’s meaningful to your personal and professional goals. Learning from instructors who are active in their field will provide you with a unique experience as a student: they understand your goals, challenge you in the classroom, celebrate your milestones, and support you if you encounter any challenges during your experience balancing your college education with the rest of your responsibilities. We appreciate our talented, dynamic instructors. quick links Academics Apply & Register Tuition & Aid Why UNH CPS Online More to Explore Student Success Blog Resources Take a Course View Course Schedule Copyright © 2026, University of New Hampshire. All rights reserved. TTY Users: 7-1-1 or 800-735-2964 (Relay NH) USNH Privacy Policies  • USNH Terms of Use  • Accessibility  • Statement of Nondiscrimination  • Jeanne Clery Act CONTACT US UNH CPS Online 88 Commercial St. Manchester, NH 03101 (855) 472-4255 Contact Us College of Professional Studies Online Academics Show Academics submenu Associate Degrees Bachelor’s Degrees Three-Year (90 credit) Applied Bachelor's Degrees Master’s Degrees Post-Baccalaureate Teacher Licensure Minors Academic Catalog Early College Online Why UNH CPS Online Hide Why UNH CPS Online submenu Affordable Tuition Online Flexibility Respect for Prior Learning & Transfer Credit Show Respect for Prior Learning & Transfer Credit submenu CCSNH Partnership Military & VA Friendly Expert Faculty Personalized Advising Career Support Student Success Blog Accreditations and Achievements Employer partnerships & tuition benefits Apply & Register Show Apply & Register submenu Apply Now Show Apply Now submenu Undergraduate Apply Now Graduate Apply Now International Students Transfer Credit Evaluation Show Transfer Credit Evaluation submenu Credit for What You Know Take a Course Community College of the Air Force